assets
────────────────────────
id
asset_class
isin (main identifier found in tradebook)
name (copy of symbol only)
symbol
amfi_scheme_code BIGINT NULL
status
version

UNIQUE (isin)
UNIQUE (amfi_scheme_code)

Call https://api.tigzig.com/mf/v1/nav?scheme=INF200K01RP8&latest=true to get the price details and amfi scheme code.

asset_price_history
────────────────────────
id
asset_id
price
price_date
source
synced_at
version

FOREIGN KEY (asset_id) → assets(id)


asset_latest_prices
────────────────────────
id
asset_id
price
price_date
source
synced_at
next_price_sync_after
version

UNIQUE (asset_id)
FOREIGN KEY (asset_id) → assets(id)


investment_pots (create default pots once user onboarded)
────────────────────────
id
user_id
name
status
version

UNIQUE(user_id, name)
FOREIGN KEY (user_id) → users(id)


investment_accounts (Create default accounts once user onboarded)
────────────────────────
id
user_id
name        -- Ex. My Zerodha Account 1
account_identifier  -- actual broker/account identifier
status
version

UNIQUE(user_id, account_identifier)
UNIQUE(user_id, name)
FOREIGN KEY (user_id) → users(id)

Default investment_accounts to be created at the time of user onboarding:
user_id: asljda-sljl-asjdl-asjdla
account_identifier: "will be filled at the time of initial statement uploaded to a specific account user selected"
name: My Dmat Account 1
status: ACTIVE
version: 1

user_id: asljda-sljl-asjdl-asjdla
account_identifier: "will be filled at the time of initial statement uploaded to a specific account user selected"
name: My Dmat Account 2
status: ACTIVE
version: 1


investment_account_assets
────────────────────────
id
user_id
account_id
asset_id
status
version

UNIQUE(user_id, account_id, asset_id)
FOREIGN KEY (account_id) → investment_accounts(id)
FOREIGN KEY (asset_id) → assets(id)
FOREIGN KEY (user_id) → users(id)


investment_transactions
────────────────────────
id
user_id
account_asset_id

transaction_type       -- BUY / SELL
units
price
amount

transaction_date
source                 -- STATEMENT / MANUAL
source_reference_id    -- Any transaction id provided by the broker/source in statment.  Could be nullable.
fingerprint

allocation_status      -- UNALLOCATED / PARTIAL / ALLOCATED
version

UNIQUE(user_id, fingerprint)
FOREIGN KEY (account_asset_id) → investment_account_assets(id)
FOREIGN KEY (user_id) → users(id)


investment_transaction_pot_allocations
────────────────────────
id
user_id
transaction_id
pot_id

allocation_method      -- PERCENTAGE / AMOUNT / UNITS
allocation_value

allocated_units
allocated_amount

version

UNIQUE(user_id, transaction_id, pot_id)
FOREIGN KEY (transaction_id) → investment_transactions(id)
FOREIGN KEY (pot_id) → investment_pots(id)
FOREIGN KEY (user_id) → users(id)






<==== Derived/Read Models ====>

pot_investment_positions
────────────────────────
id
user_id
pot_id
account_asset_id

units
current_value

version

UNIQUE (user_id, pot_id, account_asset_id)
FOREIGN KEY (pot_id) → investment_pots(id)
FOREIGN KEY (account_asset_id) → investment_account_assets(id)
FOREIGN KEY (user_id) → users(id)


investment_positions
────────────────────────
id
user_id
account_asset_id

units
current_value

version

UNIQUE (user_id, account_asset_id)
FOREIGN KEY (account_asset_id) → investment_account_assets(id)
FOREIGN KEY (user_id) → users(id)


Notes:
 - created_at and updated_at are must for all the models so not added explicitly.
 - Primary key is always (id)